{"version":"0.218.15","slug":"0-218-15","date":"2024-05-14","url":"https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/892970/view/5768625435413505333","kind":"content","title":{"en":"Ashlands"},"intro":["The world is heating up and in the south something is stirring... The creatures of the Ashlands come to life as the biome update is here at last!","After three weeks in the Public Test Branch, we believe we have ironed out most of the wrinkles with the update already, but please keep in mind that hotfixes and such are still likely to happen within the near future! Feedback and bugs are best sent in via the support page on our website.","Before you dive into the game, please do take a look at our preparation guide. This guide touches important matters such as world generation and mods.","You will find the abbreviated patch notes further down, and the detailed patch notes (full of spoilers) below those. Please respect those who don't want to see spoilers before they play.","If you have missed out on our gameplay trailer, it's available on our YouTube channel, but right now we want to get your blood pumping with this animated release trailer!"],"sections":[{"title":"Abbreviated Patch Notes","major":true},{"title":"New content","major":true},{"title":"New Biome – Ashlands","lines":[{"text":"30+ New weapons","dir":"new"},{"text":"New bombs and ammunitions","dir":"new"},{"text":"3 New armour sets","dir":"new"},{"text":"2 New capes","dir":"new"},{"text":"10+ New creatures","dir":"new"},{"text":"70+ New buildable items","dir":"new"},{"text":"5 New crafting station upgrades","dir":"new"},{"text":"30+ New crafting materials","dir":"new"},{"text":"15+ New food items and potions","dir":"new"},{"text":"New locations","dir":"new"},{"text":"New music","dir":"new"},{"text":"New events","dir":"new"},{"text":"New mechanics","dir":"new"}]},{"title":"Fixes & Improvements","lines":[{"text":"Fixed Mead materials","dir":"fix"},{"text":"Standardised texts throughout the game","dir":"mid"},{"text":"Various fixes and improvements","dir":"mid"}]},{"title":"Detailed Patch Notes","major":true},{"title":"New content","major":true},{"title":"Mechanics","lines":[{"text":"Beware the skies! Cinders rain down from above in the Ashlands, causing damage to those who are unprotected","dir":"mid","refs":["biomes/ashlands"]},{"text":"Wooden build pieces can now catch fire in the Ashlands – and the fire spreads!","dir":"mid","refs":["biomes/ashlands"]},{"text":"A new world modifier that allows fire to spread outside of the Ashlands as well (part of the immersive preset)","dir":"mid","refs":["biomes/ashlands"]},{"text":"Deadly lava takes up large parts of the landscape; traverse it with your very own platforms","dir":"mid"},{"text":"Lay claim to Charred Fortresses with two new Siege Machines","dir":"new"},{"text":"New plantable Ashvines will grow on the walls of your base","dir":"new"},{"text":"Combine your Flametal weapons with gems (Bloodstone, Iolite & Jade) in order to upgrade them to magical weapons (giving them blood, storm and nature based effects respectively)","dir":"mid","refs":["materials/bloodstone","materials/flametal","materials/iolite","materials/jade"]},{"text":"The waters in and around the Ashlands are boiling hot, and only the sturdiest of ships can sail them","dir":"mid","refs":["biomes/ashlands"]}]},{"title":"Creatures","lines":[{"text":"Enemy: Fallen Valkyrie","dir":"new","refs":["creatures/fallen-valkyrie"]},{"text":"Enemy: Charred Warrior","dir":"new","refs":["creatures/charred-warrior"]},{"text":"Enemy: Charred Archer","dir":"new"},{"text":"Enemy: Charred Warlock","dir":"new","refs":["creatures/charred-warlock"]},{"text":"Enemy: Charred Twitcher","dir":"new","refs":["creatures/charred-twitcher"]},{"text":"Enemy Turret: Skugg","dir":"new"},{"text":"Enemy: Morgen","dir":"new","refs":["creatures/morgen"]},{"text":"Enemy: Bonemaw Serpent","dir":"new","refs":["creatures/bonemaw","creatures/serpent"]},{"text":"Enemy/creature: Asksvin (tameable & rideable)","dir":"new","refs":["creatures/asksvin"]},{"text":"Creature: Asksvin Calf","dir":"new","refs":["creatures/asksvin"]},{"text":"Enemy: Volture","dir":"new","refs":["creatures/volture"]},{"text":"Enemy: Lava Blob","dir":"new","refs":["creatures/lava-blob"]},{"text":"NPC/Enemy: Redbeard Dvergr","dir":"new"},{"text":"Boss: Fader","dir":"new","refs":["creatures/fader"]},{"text":"Miniboss: Lord Reto","dir":"new","refs":["creatures/lord-reto"]},{"text":"Spawner: Monument of Torment","dir":"new"},{"text":"Spawner: Effigy of Malice","dir":"new"}]},{"title":"Crafting","lines":[{"text":"Material: Majestic Carapace (previously Queen Drop)","dir":"new","refs":["materials/majestic-carapace"]},{"text":"Material: Fader Relic (placeholder item)","dir":"new","refs":["creatures/fader"]},{"text":"Material: Asksvin Hide","dir":"new","refs":["materials/asksvin-hide"]},{"text":"Material: Asksvin Bladder","dir":"new","refs":["materials/asksvin-bladder"]},{"text":"Material: Asksvin Tail","dir":"new","refs":["materials/asksvin-tail"]},{"text":"Material: Morgen Heart","dir":"new","refs":["materials/morgen-heart"]},{"text":"Material: Morgen Sinew","dir":"new","refs":["materials/morgen-sinew"]},{"text":"Material: Celestial Feather","dir":"new","refs":["materials/celestial-feather"]},{"text":"Material: Bonemaw Meat","dir":"new","refs":["materials/bonemaw-meat"]},{"text":"Material: Bonemaw Tooth","dir":"new","refs":["materials/bonemaw-tooth"]},{"text":"Material: Volture Meat","dir":"new","refs":["materials/volture-meat"]},{"text":"Material: Volture Egg","dir":"new","refs":["materials/volture-egg"]},{"text":"Material: Charred Skull","dir":"new","refs":["materials/charred-skull"]},{"text":"Material: Charred Bone","dir":"new","refs":["materials/charred-bone"]},{"text":"Material: Pot Shard","dir":"new","refs":["materials/pot-shard"]},{"text":"Material: Bell Shard","dir":"new","refs":["materials/bell"]},{"text":"Material: Dyrnwyn Fragments x3","dir":"new","refs":["weapons/dyrnwyn"]},{"text":"Material: Bloo